      "content": "but it's not just \"letting go\" of the struggle. it feels more like there's nothing left to hold onto. if the person who lived all those years and made those choices isn't here... then what's actually left? it just feels like i'm a hollow shell. is there even a point to waiting for something that isn't coming back?",
